ch). Emitting this model gives that profile back."},"completeness":"partial","engine":{"id":"nord-wave-2","name":"Nord Wave 2","description":"Nord Wave 2 four-layer performance synthesizer: every control of its manual's MIDI controller list.","sources":[{"type":"manual","title":"Nord Wave 2 User Manual, OS v1.2x, Edition G","notes":"MIDI controller list (page 36 of the PDF) read by tools/profiles/nord/read-nord-cc.mjs from Nord Wave 2 English User Manual v1.2X Edition G.pdf (sha256 3cc9ff6c98a8fbe29663fcbd57374565e196b9ddd81d2547457f2ed32be796b3), https://www.nordkeyboards.com/wt/documents/82/Nord%20Wave%202%20English%20User%20Manual%20v1.2X%20Edition%20G.pdf. Not yet checked against the instrument itself."}],"testedWith":[],"authoringNotes":["Generated by tools/profiles/nord/make-profiles.mjs; edit the layout in tools/profiles/nord/synths/, not this file.","Every parameter is a row of the manual's MIDI controller list, with its printed name, sent as the control change it prints on the channel variable. Nothing here has been sent to a real instrument yet.","The list prints controller numbers only: every value is 0 - 127, and a setting chosen from a list (a model, a waveform, an effect type) is a number here, not a choice.","Set the channel variable to the Global MIDI channel or a Layer's own, as the manual describes for the Wave 2's four Layers.","Messages the list gives to two rows, both laid out: CC 94: Delay Tempo Tap/Set, Delay Rate. CEditor sends either, and follows neither when the instrument sends it.","Left out, the pedals, the wheel and bank select: 0 Bank Select MSB, 32 Bank Select LSB, 64 Sustain, 11 Ctrl Pedal (Expression)."],"coverage":{"singleParameterWrite":"complete-for-the-manual's-MIDI-controller-list","realtimeEditing":"complete-for-the-manual's-MIDI-controller-list","editBufferDumpRequest":"notImplemented","editBufferDumpParse":"notImplemented","bankDump":"notImplemented","inboundControllers":"the instrument sends these same messages when its pan